<Slide style={{ background: '#F0E4D2' }}>
  <Box style={{ height: 120, paddingLeft: 64, paddingRight: 64, paddingTop: 22, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 14 }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 8, height: 40, background: '#7E9476', borderRadius: 4 }} />
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#3E2A1E' }}>第 3 步：連接 EC2（瀏覽器免裝嘢）</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 540, paddingLeft: 64, paddingRight: 64, paddingTop: 10, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 14, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
    {[['EC2 → Instances → 揀 aurora-clinic → 撳 Connect'],['揀「EC2 Instance Connect」→ 撳 Connect（瀏覽器彈出黑色 terminal，完全免裝軟件）'],['之後所有指令都喺呢個 terminal 入面打，複製貼上就得']].map((s, i) => (
      <Box key={i} style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 14 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 30, height: 30, borderRadius: 15, background: '#7E9476', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#fff' }}>{i + 1}</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#3E2A1E' }}>{s[0]}</Text>
      </Box>
    ))}
    <Box style={{ backgroundColor: '#5D4037', borderRadius: 14, padding: '16px 20px', marginTop: 6 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#F0E4D2' }}>進階：用 Mac 終端機 SSH 登入</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#F0E4D2', lineHeight: 1.7, marginTop: 8 }}>Mac 已經內置 SSH，唔使裝 PuTTY。落咗嘅 .pem 鑰匙要先改權限：chmod 400 aurora-key.pem，然後打 ssh -i aurora-key.pem ubuntu@&lt;Public-IP&gt; 就登入。新手直接用上面嘅瀏覽器方法最簡單。</Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 60, paddingLeft: 64, paddingRight: 64, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7c6f63' }}>寶天醫館 · AWS 上線手把手教學</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7c6f63' }}>09 / 18</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
